<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets warrants on Guangzhou Inv.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on Guangzhou Inv.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Monday it had issued 839 million call warrants on Guangzhou Investment shares.</p>
<p>Ten warrants represent one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$3.52	 PREMIUM	 29.66 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.0629     GEARING	 5.1X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 23.MARCH.98   PAYDATE	 2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG     MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$3.20	 GOVERNING LAW HONG KONG.</p>
<p>NOTE - Settlement in shares in Guangzhou Investment with cash alternative at discretion of issuer.-- HK Newsroom (852)28436441</p>
</text>
